     "i": "3",
     "x": "$0$"
    }
   ],
   "a": "2",
   "e": [
    "$A-B=\\begin{bmatrix}0-(-3)&1-1\\\\1-1&2-(-2)\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}3&0\\\\0&4\\end{bmatrix}$.",
    "$\\det(A-B)=3\\cdot4-0\\cdot0=12$.",
    "Note that $\\det(A-B)\\neq\\det A-\\det B$: here $\\det A=-1$, $\\det B=5$, so $\\det A-\\det B=-6$."
   ]
  },
