    {
     "i": "3",
     "x": "$\\det\\big[(B^{-1}A^{-1})^T\\big]$"
    }
   ],
   "a": "3",
   "e": [
    "Left side: $\\det\\big[((AB)^T)^{-1}\\big]=\\dfrac1{\\det((AB)^T)}=\\dfrac1{\\det(A)\\det(B)}$.",
    "(a): $\\det\\big[(A^{-1}B)^T\\big]=\\det(A^{-1})\\det(B)=\\dfrac{\\det B}{\\det A}$. Not equal.",
    "(b): $\\det\\big[(A^TB^{-1})^{-1}\\big]=\\dfrac1{\\det(A)\\det(B^{-1})}=\\dfrac{\\det B}{\\det A}$. Not equal.",
    "(c): $\\det\\big[(B^{-1}A^{-1})^T\\big]=\\det(B^{-1})\\det(A^{-1})=\\dfrac1{\\det(B)\\det(A)}$. Equal, so (c) is correct."
   ]
  },
