   "a": "1",
   "e": [
    "$B^{-1}$ exists, so $B$ is invertible and $\\det(B)\\neq0$.",
    "$\\det(AB)=\\det(A)\\det(B)$ and $\\det(B^{-1})=\\dfrac1{\\det(B)}$.",
    "So $\\det(A)\\det(B)=\\dfrac1{\\det(B)}\\Rightarrow\\det(A)=\\dfrac1{[\\det(B)]^2}$.",
    "A positive number divided into $1$ is positive, so $\\det(A)>0$."
   ]
